WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:02.100
<b>Captain Kuro of
a Thousand Plans</b>

38
00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:58.350
[PIRATE A] What was that?!

39
00:01:57.890 --> 00:01:59.640
[PIRATE B] It's sorcery!

40
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:00.730
[PIRATE C] Uh! He's a freak!

41
00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:02.100
[PIRATE D] A magical freak!

42
00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:05.650
[PIRATE E] He sent
Captain Kuro flying!

43
00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.290
I'll just leave this to you.

44
00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:26.540
[groans]

45
00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.460
I've got treasure to find.

46
00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:31.130
[KIDS]
The Usopp Pirates!

47
00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.930
Have arrived!

48
00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:36.340
No! Don't!

49
00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.350
Stay away!

50
00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.510
[PEPPER] Say
your prayers, butler!

51
00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:41.770
[CARROT] Take
that! And that!

52
00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:44.100
[ONION] Game over,
you lousy, no good pirate!

53
00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.810
No! Stop it!

54
00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:49.440
Uh! Those kids!
What're they doin'?!

55
00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.110
Those rug rats have
a death wish.

56
00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.820
You don't know
what you're doing! Stop!

57
00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:56.780
Stop!

58
00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:00.950
[PEPPER] Alright!

59
00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:03.620
This time, we'll let you off
without any more brutality!

60
00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.790
This time.

61
00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:05.960
[whimpers]

62
00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.130
Now those stupid kids
have really done it.

63
00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:10.420
Captain Kuro
is gonna be so mad.

64
00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:13.210
[CARROT] Captain!

65
00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.720
I knew it. You were fighting!
Gosh that is so totally awesome!

66
00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.840
I thought there were
no secrets between us pirates.

67
00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.140
Why didn't you tell us?

68
00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:21.640
That right! We're supposed
to tell each other everything!

69
00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:23.180
Who cares about that?!

70
00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.730
Look, this is important!

71
00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:27.230
You guys gotta get
outta here! Run!

72
00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:28.980
No way!

73
00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.980
We have to stay
and fight with you!

74
00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:34.150
The Usopp Pirates will be
shamed if we run in fear!

75
00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.000
[ALL wheezing]

76
00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.960
[USOPP] You idiots!
Don't scream, run!

77
00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.720
– [thud]
– [KAYA gasps]

78
00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:00.390
[USOPP groaning]

79
00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:01.890
[KIDS] Captain!

80
00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:07.640
[KURO] That hurt.

81
00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.400
Hmm. My, my.

82
00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:13.270
That's quite a strange technique
you've developed there.

83
00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.650
Tell me something.

84
00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.940
Do you have powers
from eating the devil fruit?

85
00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:20.320
[chuckles] Yep.
I'm a rubber man.

86
00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.910
[PIRATES whimpering, yelping]

87
00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.580
[PIRATE D] Ah!
He ate the devil fruit!

88
00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:25.870
[PIRATE E] That guy's dangerous!

89
00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.790
[PIRATE F] Those devil fruit people are real!

90
00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.250
[PIRATE G] He's got
rubber arms of death!

91
00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.130
It all makes
perfect sense now.

92
00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:34.710
I didn't just hallucinate
his arms stretching out like that.

93
00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:36.960
[KURO] Jango!

94
00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:37.470
Uh! Sir!

95
00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:39.300
I can handle the boy.

96
00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:43.050
You take care of Miss Kaya
like we planned.

97
00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:47.230
Have her write
her butler into her will.

98
00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.310
Then kill her.

99
00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:53.610
As for the kids, they're
an eyesore. Eliminate them.

100
00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.190
I'm on it.

101
00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:04.030
[ZORO] Stop right there.

102
00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.330
If you wanna get to them, you'll have
to make it through me first.

103
00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:08.620
[JANGO] Butchie!

104
00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:12.460
[growling]

105
00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:15.960
[BUTCHIE] Cat-tastrophe!

106
00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.760
Not again.

107
00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.390
[PIRATES yelping]

108
00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.710
That guy.

109
00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.960
He's crazy.

110
00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:56.090
Oh no, Kaya.

111
00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:59.800
[USOPP] No.
Stay away from her.

112
00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.800
No. Don't...

113
00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.260
No. No!

114
00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:11.520
Usopp Pirates!

115
00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:14.850
[KIDS] Yes, sir!

116
00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.110
[USOPP] I need
you to listen carefully!

117
00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.520
Look. We're not running!

118
00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.320
Not after they did this to you!

119
00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:22.700
[ONION] We will avenge you!

120
00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:24.570
Protect... Kaya!

121
00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:30.870
[USOPP] Do as I say.
Don't argue with me.

122
00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:34.830
I'm giving you the most important task
there is right now.

123
00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.880
It's absolutely critical
that you succeed.

124
00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.670
Take Kaya, and get
away from here.

125
00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.720
You must keep her safe.

126
00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:45.130
This is the reason
we wanted to be pirates.

127
00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.140
To protect what's dear to us!

128
00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:50.100
So do as I say... and run!

129
00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:53.850
Usopp...

130
00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:02.320
Now go. That's a direct order.

131
00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:05.280
[ALL] Yes! Captain!

132
00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:06.320
[CARROT] Kaya, hurry!

133
00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.280
[ONION] This way!

134
00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.370
[PEPPER] C'mon, let's go!

135
00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.700
[ZORO] He's sure got
a way with words.

136
00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.750
He made running
away sound brave.

137
00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:15.000
[CARROT] I know these woods
like the back of my hand.

138
00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.170
[KAYA] Okay.

139
00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:20.290
Jango.

140
00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:22.760
Yeah! Sorry, I was gawking.

141
00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:25.930
Those fools. Do they really think
that they can escape me?

142
00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:27.970
[JANGO screams]

143
00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:28.720
– [thud]
– [JANGO grunts]

144
00:07:27.970 --> 00:07:31.140
[chuckles] Gotcha.

145
00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.100
[JANGO growls] Damn you!

146
00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:36.640
He's not a priority right now!

147
00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.310
Yes, sir!

148
00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:44.690
[KURO] Their attempt
at escape is futile.

149
00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:49.120
We know all too well
how weak Kaya is.

150
00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:52.120
There is no way they can
possibly escape Jango.

151
00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.250
Now, if you want
to help her, go ahead.

152
00:07:56.710 --> 00:08:00.920
But first, you'll have to get
off this hill alive. Usopp.

153
00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.090
[KURO]
Butchie!

154
00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:13.010
[ZORO] I guess losing to me once
wasn't enough for you, huh?

155
00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:17.270
I told you to get outta my way,
you drooling tub of lard!

156
00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.140
Now move!

157
00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.150
[BUTCHIE yelling]

158
00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:05.480
Onion, is that weird hypnotist guy
still behind us?!

159
00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.150
I don't know I can't see
him anymore.

160
00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.940
Let's make sure
and lose him for good!

161
00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:12.450
There's no way that nut job
could catch up to us in our own forest!

162
00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:13.740
[ONION] Don't
you worry, Miss Kaya!

163
00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:16.990
The Usopp Pirates are gonna
keep you safe and sound!

164
00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:20.000
[PEPPER] That's right!
The Usopp Pirates stand by their word!

165
00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:23.130
[KAYA] Thank you so much.

166
00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:26.300
[ALL panting]

167
00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:30.010
[ALL gasp]

168
00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:49.280
[JANGO] Well,
they're not there.

169
00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:52.320
Fools, I'm coming to get you!

170
00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.700
Do you really think
you can run from me?!

171
00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:03.040
[JANGO] We could do this the easy way,
or I could just level this entire forest!

172
00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.500
[CARROT] Whoa!
That guy is really mad.

173
00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.760
[PEPPER] And he can do a lot
more than just hypnotize people!

174
00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:16.430
Where have you gone?

175
00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.480
Wait... What was that sound?

176
00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.110
[KURO] That is the sound
of destruction.

177
00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:35.240
Jango's probably tearing
the place apart.

178
00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:39.540
Go ahead. See for yourself
if you can get up.

179
00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:46.460
Heartless bastard! Don't you
even have a shred of pity?

180
00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.590
You lived with that girl
for three years!

181
00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:53.970
[KURO] No. I've told you, Kaya is nothing more
than a pawn in the game I intend to win.

182
00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:57.680
When she's dead, then
I'll be grateful to her.

183
00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.560
[USOPP] Damn you!

184
00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:02.470
[ZORO] This guy
is hopelessly evil.

185
00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:05.900
[LUFFY] We should put
him out of his misery.

186
00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:08.860
Hey!

187
00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.780
Usopp! Go find the others!

188
00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:16.280
Don't worry, we'll take
care of this guy.

189
00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:18.570
Go on.

190
00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:32.920
Very impressive.
You can still move.

191
00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:31.920
[KURO] Ah.

192
00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.300
[USOPP] Shut up!

193
00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:38.180
You won't get away with this!

194
00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:39.640
I won't let you!

195
00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:42.310
You betrayed the villager's
trust. Not to mention

196
00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:46.640
you planned to take the life
of a sweet young girl!

197
00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:50.060
This is the last time
you ever get your way!

198
00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.230
[USOPP groaning]

199
00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.320
Usopp!

200
00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:02.160
It hurts... It hurts so

201
00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:09.000
[laughing]

202
00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:12.920
[KURO] You really are a riot.

203
00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:16.010
Just stay on the ground there.

204
00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:19.840
[JANGO] Hah. Even if you did
somehow catch up to Jango,

205
00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:22.640
he'd end your life
in the blink of an eye.

206
00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:24.970
Staying there is
what's best for you.

207
00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.310
[JANGO laughs]

208
00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:29.440
[USOPP] I don't care.

209
00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:32.610
I don't care that I'm weak.
I'll protect them.

210
00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:35.860
I'm Captain
of the Usopp Pirates.

211
00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:39.490
A brave warrior of the sea who
fights for what he holds dear!

212
00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:43.030
I will protect everyone
in the village if it kills me!

213
00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:49.290
On my word, you will never
set foot in that village!

214
00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.170
[PIRATE H] What's his deal?

215
00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:56.170
[PIRATE I] He's yellin'
about something!

216
00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.630
[PIRATE J] Check it out
he's crying!

217
00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:04.430
[PIRATES laughing]

218
00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.270
[PIRATES yelping]

219
00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.230
What's so funny?!

220
00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:17.400
[ZORO] Luffy!

221
00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.240
Me and Usopp are gonna
chase down that hypno freak.

222
00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.450
Is that a problem?

223
00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:23.280
[LUFFY] No. Hurry!

224
00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.910
Hey. Thank you.

225
00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:27.870
I'd be a whole lot faster
if I was going by myself.

226
00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.410
But I don't know those woods,

227
00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:32.620
so if we're gonna catch up
to them, I'm gonna need your help.

228
00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:38.210
Who gave you permission
to go anywhere?

229
00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.840
[LUFFY] I did!

230
00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.470
Usopp! Zoro! Get goin'!

231
00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.470
[LUFFY] Have another!

232
00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:53.730
[LUFFY] Gum-Gum!

233
00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:55.610
Spear!

234
00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.230
[LUFFY] Man,
he disappeared again!

235
00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:01.820
[LUFFY] The others got away.

236
00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.910
That's the most important thing, really.

237
00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:07.990
[KURO] Before I kill you,
I feel compelled to ask.

238
00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:12.830
What is an outsider like you butting
into this villages' business for?

239
00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.920
[chuckles] Because there's
a man in this village

240
00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:16.420
that I don't wanna let die.

241
00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.880
[chuckles] Simple enough.

242
00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:22.260
Are you okay with that being
the reason that you die?

243
00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:23.970
Sure am.

244
00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:25.340
Ha! But I'm not gonna die!

245
00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.810
We'll see about that.

246
00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.850
[LUFFY yelling]

247
00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.560
[LUFFY] Gum-Gum Whip!

248
00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.980
And Pistol!

249
00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:47.030
This is quite boring!

250
00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.490
You cocky jerk!

251
00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.840
Go east! Hey, I said go east!
So go east already!

252
00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:00.000
This is the wrong direction!

253
00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.300
[ZORO] Fine, east.
Is that left or right?!

254
00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:03.420
[USOPP] Turn right!

255
00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.630
[ZORO] But that's
where we came from!

256
00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.840
[KAYA grunts]

257
00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.010
[PEPPER, ONION, CARROT gasp]

258
00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.560
Miss Kaya!

259
00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:15.140
[KAYA] I'm sorry. You
should go on with out me.

260
00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.270
[CARROT] What
are you talking about?!

261
00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:19.400
We are under strict orders
to protect you!

262
00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.570
[ONION] Oh no! She's got
a really bad fever!

263
00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.650
[CARROT] What?!
Hang in there, Kaya!

264
00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:25.780
A doctor! We need a doctor!

265
00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:28.160
[PEPPER] You idiot!
We don't have time for that!

266
00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:29.950
Someone's tryin' to kill her!

267
00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.790
[ONION] But it's dangerous
for her to run anymore!

268
00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.080
[PEPPER] Yeah, but...

269
00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:36.460
[JANGO] Show
yourselves, you runts!

270
00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.050
[ALL gasp]

271
00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:47.430
[KAYA] Thank you...
for helping me.

272
00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:52.510
Just the thought is more than enough.
Now go, all of you.

273
00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.060
Where did you brats go?!

274
00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:02.860
[PEPPER] If we left Kaya and ran away
right now, we would probably survive, right?

275
00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:05.030
[ONION] Yeah. Probably.

276
00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:06.860
[CARROT] And our Captain
always said to run

277
00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:10.530
with your tail between your legs
if you think you're gonna lose.

278
00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.200
Then again,
our captain is a liar.

279
00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:17.750
But even he didn't take
his own advice.

280
00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:19.750
He tried so hard to protect us.

281
00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.960
He risked his life for us!

282
00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:26.170
[CARROT sighs] I swore
to protect Kaya!

283
00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:29.180
[PEPPER] Alright then! Prepare
yourselves, Usopp Pirates!

284
00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:30.220
[ONION] We gotta fight him!

285
00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.350
[CARROT] Let's do it!

286
00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:34.930
Stop this! You're no match
for him, you're only kids!

287
00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:37.520
You mustn't put your life
on the line for my sake!

288
00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.520
If we don't wanna die,
we have to fight for our lives!

289
00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.180
[LUFFY]
Owww.

290
00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.150
He nicked me.

291
00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:46.780
Kuro laid him out flat.

292
00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:49.490
Lotta good that devil fruit did him.

293
00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:52.700
Yeah. That's Captain Kuro for ya.

294
00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:59.120
[PIRATES cheering]

295
00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.080
Shut up. Don't call me that!

296
00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.880
[PIRATES] Huh?

297
00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:07.050
[KURO] You still don't get it.

298
00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:09.880
You fools. This whole plan was devised,

299
00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:14.760
so that I may be rid
of that name once and for all.

300
00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.850
I'm tired of it.

301
00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:20.560
Concocting plans every day
for a bunch of barbarians

302
00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:23.440
who care only
about havoc and mayhem.

303
00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:27.530
Relentlessly attacked by
government dogs and bounty hunters.

304
00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:28.530
I'm tired of it.

305
00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:32.450
I am sick and tired
of that entire cursed life!

306
00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:36.490
[explosion]

307
00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:39.710
[KURO] The Navy, huh?

308
00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:43.380
<b>Kuro of a Thousand Plans
(3 Years Ago)</b>

309
00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:43.670
This is the third time this week.

310
00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:45.420
Well, can you
really blame them?

311
00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:49.010
You're one of the most famous pirates
sailing the seas right now.

312
00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:51.680
Captain Kuro is a superstar.

313
00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:53.510
[KURO] You're right.

314
00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:57.680
My infamy is
what draws them to us.

315
00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.980
That's why I'm going
to give up being Captain Kuro.

316
00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.850
[explosion]

317
00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:05.610
Yeah, wouldn't that be nice.

318
00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:10.360
Except... the Marines won't stop
their pursuit until Captain Kuro is dead.

319
00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:14.570
[explosion]

320
00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:17.580
[KURO] I am going to die.

321
00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:22.710
It would seem that the tumultuous life
of a pirate just isn't for me.

322
00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:24.080
[JANGO] You can't quit, sir.

323
00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.830
You're the ship's captain.

324
00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.590
[KURO] You can be
captain now.

325
00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.720
I have finally grown
weary of this life.

326
00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:39.310
It's over. I'm killing
myself for all to see.

327
00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:40.970
Sir! Captain Kuro!

328
00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.020
Captain!

329
00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:44.770
[KURO] How many vessels are there?

330
00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:46.400
One! Just one this time.

331
00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:47.900
What should we do, Captain?!
Should we man the cannons?!

332
00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.150
We could blast them
to splinters!

333
00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.490
[KURO] Lower a small boat
into the water.

334
00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:53.360
[PIRATE S] What?!

335
00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.200
[KURO] A boat! Now!

336
00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.620
[PIRATE S] Vice Captain Jango!

337
00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:00.330
Captain Kuro just...!

338
00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:01.660
[JANGO] Yeah, I know.

339
00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:02.790
[PIRATE O] "Yeah, I know"?

340
00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:05.170
It's too dangerous
for him to go there by himself!

341
00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.880
[PIRATE S] Don't tell me
he's turning himself in.

342
00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:19.890
[PIRATES whimpering]

343
00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:23.730
[PIRATE R] What?!

344
00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:25.600
[PIRATE G] The cannon fire stopped.

345
00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.230
[JANGO] Prepare
to board the ship.

346
00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:28.860
[PIRATE T] But...
sir! Shouldn't we...?

347
00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:31.230
I didn't ask for your opinion.
That's an order.

348
00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:32.150
[PIRATE T] Yes, sir!

349
00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.240
[PIRATE R] Better get ready...

350
00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:36.410
[JANGO] I see.
So that's why you...

351
00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.860
– [PIRATE H] On three!
– [PIRATES yell]

352
00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.420
[PIRATE T] The Marines.

353
00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.670
[PIRATE V] They've
been wiped out.

354
00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:57.630
[KURO] Now then.

355
00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:01.810
[KURO] Let's begin this plan.

356
00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:09.060
C'mon, pull yourself together.

357
00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:12.230
I was kind enough to let
you and you alone survive.

358
00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.940
Just... do it.

359
00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:22.780
I'm not kneeling to you Finish me off
and get it over with.

360
00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.790
– [thud]
– [MORGAN groans]

361
00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:26.750
You'll be perfect.

362
00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:31.000
If you can still howl this much with
a shattered jaw, you should do fine.

363
00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.340
[chuckles]

364
00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:36.050
Today is the greatest day
of your life.

365
00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:39.430
Today is the day
you captured Captain Kuro.

366
00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:42.850
You should be ever
so grateful to me.

367
00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:46.980
I'm giving you,
the head of Captain Kuro.

368
00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:49.270
[JANGO] Your name
is Captain Kuro.

369
00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:52.190
Your name is Captain Kuro.

370
00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:55.070
This atrocity was your doing.

371
00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:58.950
One. Two. Jango!

372
00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:04.370
My name is Captain Kuro.
This atrocity was my doing.

373
00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:08.790
[JANGO] And you are the brave Marine
who caught the infamous Captain Kuro.

374
00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:11.830
Return to base and see
that he gets executed.

375
00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.840
One. Two.

376
00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:14.800
Jango!

377
00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:19.630
I am the brave Marine who caught
the infamous Captain Kuro!

378
00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:22.220
[PIRATE W] You're doing
it again, Vice Captain.

379
00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:23.640
[KURO] Perfect.

380
00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:27.640
When my double gets executed,
Captain Kuro will disappear from the earth

381
00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.480
and I will live
the life I deserve.

382
00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.480
[KURO] And when my plan
succeeds today,

383
00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:37.650
after three years of planning,
revising, and waiting;

384
00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:40.990
my goal will be achieved
in its entirety.

385
00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:44.120
Wealth and peace of mind
will finally be mine.

386
00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.200
Do you understand now, boy?

387
00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:51.460
I will not allow this perfect plan,
years in the making, to fail!

388
00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:55.380
My plan will not be disrupted
by an urchin like you!

389
00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:04.510
It would seem that you can do
a lot more than just stretch.

390
00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:05.600
[LUFFY] That's right!

391
00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:09.390
I've been toughening myself up
to be a pirate!

392
00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:16.480
You know what?
Don't want a reputation?

393
00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.190
Then don't be a pirate!

394
00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:24.660
[chuckles]

395
00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:29.370
You're just greedy, Kuro.
But I have ambition!

396
00:22:34.750 --> 00:22:41.610
As a kid I had a dream of a dazzling treasure

397
00:22:41.810 --> 00:22:48.630
I had a map in my head that I knew would lead me

398
00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:55.730
Charted a course all on my own so nobody would beat me

399
00:22:55.850 --> 00:23:02.990
The promised land was in my hand drew a line in the sand

400
00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:08.370
Look where I am

401
00:23:10.600 --> 00:23:16.780
My one ambitions slipping right through my hands

402
00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:24.050
But if the world ever changes Ill call out your name

403
00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:31.130
We could return to a time when our lives were still the same

404
00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:38.260
Take me to the place where memories remain

405
00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:44.130
Please dont ever let them fade
